Package: limine
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern multiprotocol boot loader
 Limine boots b1nix on BIOS and UEFI machines. This package carries the
 firmware-side loaders (BOOTX64.EFI, BOOTAA64.EFI, the BIOS stages and the
 CD images) and the `limine` tool that installs the BIOS stages into a disk's
 boot sector and partition.
 .
 Built by the b1nix project from Limine's binary release, because Debian does
 not package Limine.
